<title>CHINA: Shanghai to issue 500 mln yuan construction debt.</title>
<headline>Shanghai to issue 500 mln yuan construction debt.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Shanghai city government will issue 500 million yuan worth of three-year debt from April 8 to April 28, to be used for infrastructure construction, the China Securities said on Friday.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be invested in construction of the Shanghai-Nanjing highway and Shanghai's inner city ring roads, the newspaper said. The notes bear an annual interest rate of 11 percent.</p>
<p>China Guotai Securities Co has been appointed the lead underwriter for the issue, which is the largest single batch of city debt issued by Shanghai so far, the newspaper said.</p>
</text>
